  "body": "This draft continues merged PR #293 while preserving all 100 original primary roots and 28 acceptance units. RH, Step 4 and the independent closing inequalities remain OPEN.\n\nStage 1 is published at `96dfba7082fb0cc7a93f7b25e31d449951ee9e4d`, tree `c7a86500bcb1fb9fee009cb4b4500ed8927aae82`. The [Stage 1 handover](https://github.com/HMarcusWH/zeta-23-lean/blob/96dfba7082fb0cc7a93f7b25e31d449951ee9e4d/research/RHRC/integration/opica_followup/continuation/2026-10-22/STAGE1_HANDOVER.md) links exact source, consumer, compiler and research evidence.\n\nFour original candidate roots now pass narrow module, independent full-type/domain consumer and standard-axiom gates: `laguerre_tail_norm`, `dilated_comb_fourier`, `zero_measure_first_cell_sign` and `first_cell_negative_mass_cost`. The ledger separates 41 historical source-bound roots, 10 additional narrow local results, one retained candidate and 48 absent primary implementations. This is not aggregate 51-root acceptance.\n\nThe full100 producer/reader and fresh cold replay protocol are implemented and fixture-tested; the independent full semantic review seal is deliberately unset and actual full production remains unexecuted. Parent/P0, runtime, canonical freshness and complete workflow companions remain unfinished and fail closed. A separately sealed seven-document exception repairs the inherited navigation-byte regression while preserving mathematical and registry checks.\n\nValidation: child suite185 normal +185 optimized; parent suite201 normal +201 optimized in a byte-identical Linux-native source snapshot, with genuine link/tampering tests and no skips. Four repaired modules and their independent consumers compiled warning-free with standard-only transitive axiom closures. The renderer checked14 surfaces; preparation passes and release remains closed.\n\nThe bounded all-job harvest preserves22 runs/61 jobs at the preceding9cce head, actual scientific dispositions and pending/failing/skipped work. New-head CI remains to be harvested. Full100 acceptance, facade/registration, complete type/domain/dependency reconciliation and remaining mathematics are required. Foundational PDFs and normative specifications are unchanged.\n\nStage 2 is in progress: final integration/gates for the actual native moment/residual/memory chain, noncompact weighted mixture and near-gap mass proof. No in-progress candidate is counted as accepted.",
